{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act17d0_level_act17d0_08_beg",
  "groupId": "act17d0",
  "stageId": "act17d0_08",
  "title": "Infiltration Battle",
  "storyCode": "OD-8",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_08_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "6ee7ba1d01cb159856e059c1bdf19787a39206c1f1a83460f32c7ea18c5c0a94",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "Rangers's map stops here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "It's all up to us now.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "text": "Who knew this cave would be so big?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "text": "It's like the ground beneath the town is completely hollow.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "Are the explosives okay?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "text": "We've got the strongest batch from the safehouse here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "I hope Lord's plan works.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "text": "I'm afraid it won't be that simple. Look there...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "...I hope it's not what I think it is...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Originiutant Infected",
      "text": "Gaa...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "text": "That's... a person?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Originiutant Infected",
      "text": "Gaa...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "text": "Whatever it is, it's going to die and that's enough.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "text": "I won't be surprised at whatever *profanity* showing up now...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "Keep moving! Don't get caught up in a fight with them. We don't have time to waste in here!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "text": "Understood.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "text": "...Why would Long Spring have a facility like this underneath it?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "text": "Cohen... Where are we?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "I knew it! *profanity*, I knew it!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "text": "So this is where most of the lab ended up.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "Now that I think about it, we were too careless.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "We've lived in this town for so long and we had no idea at all.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "text": "It's that psycho behind all this.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "text": "What's that smell...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "What else could it be? That's the smell of death.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "Stay frosty. And close.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "text": "What are these?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "text": "Cages? So many?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "text": "All corpses... people and beasts together...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "This is the work of Lev Klitschko, a man both mad and cruel beyond imagination. I never should've tried to take him alive. He should have a bullet in his head.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "text": "Your typical madman wouldn't do something this awful.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "text": "Wait.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "text": "...There's someone alive in that cage.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drudge",
      "text": "Heh.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drudge",
      "text": "Look who's here?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "text": "It's that Drudge character.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "I'd recognize the *profanity* anywhere.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drudge",
      "text": "Oh, it's you. The mercenaries.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drudge",
      "text": "I'm so glad to see you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drudge",
      "text": "I know we've had our differences in the past... but let's set them aside for now.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drudge",
      "text": "I have a feeling you're looking for that scientist... and I know where he is.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drudge",
      "text": "We've got a common enemy. And the enemy of my enemy is my friend.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "So brazen I'm sick to my stomach.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drudge",
      "text": "That Feline over there, I know you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drudge",
      "text": "Your skills are pretty easily recognizable. And one can hear a lot in the mercenary market in Columbia.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drudge",
      "text": "You are a killer, aren't you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drudge",
      "text": "Rhodes Island hired you, meaning even they have quite some dirty work to do.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drudge",
      "text": "Compared to others, you must know better how to weigh up the pros and cons. Let's have a talk, shall we?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "text": "Shut up. Or I can help you with that.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drudge",
      "text": "Shame. I thought people like you would be more realistic.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "Open the cage.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "text": "What...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "Don't worry about it. Just open the cage.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "text": "Got it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drudge",
      "text": "Good call. We all know the score.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "Yeah. I sure do.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drudge",
      "text": "Hold on, what are you doing?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drudge",
      "text": "Agh!!!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drudge",
      "text": "Hey! You crazy...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drudge",
      "text": "You...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drudge",
      "text": "Help me......please......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drudge",
      "text": "Please...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drudge",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drudge",
      "text": "Please... stop.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "Hah. You can still talk. Guess I'm not done.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "And this one's for Dr. Miarow.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "text": "Okay, okay, he's had enough.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "Phew...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "text": "You went a little overboard there.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "What... you feel bad for him?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "text": "Man, you almost killed him.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "text": "Totally rearranged his face.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "text": "Save your strength. We've still got work to do.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "You're right.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "text": "Pfft.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "What happened?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "text": "Nothing. I'm just feeling a lot more relaxed.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "You know what? Me too.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "text": "If he's locked up in here, he must be part of Lev's plan.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "I'm not surprised.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "text": "I don't see anyone here...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Schwarz",
      "text": "Might be an ambush ahead. Keep cautious.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "text": "Well well well, look who it is. More visitors to my laboratory?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "text": "It's been a while, my friends from Team Rainbow.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "text": "You're just in time.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "text": "No... you always come at precisely the right time.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "Tch.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "text": "Don't bother. It's bulletproof glass.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "text": "I applaud your decisiveness, squeezing the trigger without hesitation. Don't even wait for an end to our little prologue here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "text": "But we have a show to put on. A great opening requires a great audience, and a complete opening dialogue.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "text": "Today is a day of praise for the great work of the Creator. And that Creator is none other than yours truly.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "Creator? That's quite a title you've given yourself.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "You're a *profanity* psycho!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "text": "Psycho... hah. The mediocre always use this word to describe ideas and concepts they cannot understand.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "text": "Behold this world!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "text": "Completely different chemistry... totally inverted laws of physics... the flower of science blooms in exploration and doubt. And the most fertile soil lies in the land of the unknown!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "text": "And now, I have succeeded.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "text": "Do you see? Can you feel? The surface appearance is similar, but it all functions on radically different principles!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "text": "This is the evolution of life. This is the iteration of existence.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "text": "Originium is the truth of this world. You should accept that. Don't fear it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "text": "Welcome to the future.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "Don't you have even the slightest moral compunction over what you're doing?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "What does human life even mean to you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "text": "Human nature is weak, good and evil are subjective definitions of weakness, and what we call guilt is but one of the myriad cognitive signals produced by the brain.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "text": "And the science I pursue is never swayed by such flimsy concepts.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "text": "Don't delude yourselves that even in this world you still bind your minds with these meaningless ideas.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "text": "Even electronic information technology and nuclear energy were originally designed to help us kill each other more effectively.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "text": "Would you add a new layer of definition to science? Force everything to fit your fragile spiritual needs?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "text": "Nonsense.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "text": "But I forgive you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "text": "You don't have to understand. I'll allow you to go on, unknowing. Primitive thinking is a common form of ignorance. It's not your fault, and I forgive you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "text": "That's the end of my speech. And in addition to my forgiveness, I also offer you my thanks for waiting so patiently.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "text": "Now it is time for praise. Give your praise to this entirely new life form.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Levi",
      "text": "Praise be! Praise be! Praise be!!!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "text": "No matter what, we absolutely can't let that thing make it to the surface.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "text": "You stall it! I'll get the bomb ready!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
